WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.700
Match each English phrase with its meaning. Look at the verb and the word that goes with it.

2
00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:19.300
wake up = despertarse · have breakfast = desayunar · go to work = ir al trabajo · go to bed = acostarse.

3
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:30.300
Go to work and go to bed start the same way: decide by the ending. Work is your job; bed is where you sleep.
